WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:17.004
"I lost my mind," said Aladdin to his mother.

2
00:00:17.024 --> 00:00:20.386
"I have lost my heart to Princess Badra."

3
00:00:21.566 --> 00:00:22.847
"What about the sultan?"

4
00:00:23.347 --> 00:00:24.148
Zeba asked.

5
00:00:25.388 --> 00:00:27.409
"Why would he give his daughter to you?

6
00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:29.491
Who would dare ask him?"

7
00:00:29.511 --> 00:00:33.365
"You," answered Aladdin.

8
00:00:33.385 --> 00:00:36.147
"You will ask the sultan."

9
00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:39.369
"What?" Zeba shouted.

10
00:00:39.389 --> 00:00:42.951
"Me? Do you think I have lost my mind too?"

11
00:00:42.971 --> 00:00:47.294
"If you refuse, I will die," said Aladdin.

12
00:00:47.314 --> 00:00:52.878
"And if I ask the sultan such a silly thing, we will both die!"

13
00:00:53.378 --> 00:00:54.199
cried Zeba.

14
00:00:54.219 --> 00:00:57.541
"He will kill us for being too bold."

15
00:00:58.862 --> 00:01:01.044
Aladdin thought a moment and then spoke.

16
00:01:02.124 --> 00:01:03.465
"The sultan is a good man.

17
00:01:04.566 --> 00:01:06.968
The people always come to him for help and favors.

18
00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:09.350
This is well-known, Mother."

19
00:01:09.371 --> 00:01:13.074
"You speak truly," she agreed.

20
00:01:13.094 --> 00:01:18.979
"But the sultan expects a gift, a very nice gift, for his time and wisdom.

21
00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:23.002
We have nothing fancy to present to the sultan."

22
00:01:23.023 --> 00:01:26.145
"You are right," said Aladdin.

23
00:01:26.165 --> 00:01:28.908
"We need a gift that he will notice."

24
00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:32.381
His face lit up with a big smile.

25
00:01:32.401 --> 00:01:38.222
"Mother," he said, "have you forgotten the jewels I took from the enchanted treasury?

26
00:01:39.503 --> 00:01:41.443
Quick, bring our best serving bowl."

27
00:01:43.344 --> 00:01:48.145
As Zeba ran into the kitchen, Aladdin walked over to a large pot on a shelf.

28
00:01:49.226 --> 00:01:51.946
He took out a leather bag filled with jewels.

29
00:01:53.287 --> 00:01:56.628
"Here you are, son," Zeba said, as she held out the bowl.

30
00:01:58.413 --> 00:02:00.774
Aladdin poured the jewels into the bowl.

31
00:02:01.755 --> 00:02:06.579
The beautiful stones sparkled so brightly that Zeba could not look at them.

32
00:02:06.599 --> 00:02:11.383
"These are the biggest jewels in the world," said Aladdin.

33
00:02:11.403 --> 00:02:13.825
"You must take them to the sultan.

34
00:02:15.146 --> 00:02:17.568
Tell him your son wishes to marry his daughter."

35
00:02:17.588 --> 00:02:23.944
"I will do what you want, my son," said Zeba.

36
00:02:23.964 --> 00:02:28.228
She arrived at a large hall where many people had gathered to see the sultan.

37
00:02:29.289 --> 00:02:30.310
Zeba was nervous.

38
00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:33.232
The people waiting all looked very rich.

39
00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:36.275
"They must be so important!"

40
00:02:36.896 --> 00:02:37.436
she thought.

41
00:02:39.278 --> 00:02:44.743
Watching over everything was the sultan's most trusted adviser—the grand vizier.

42
00:02:45.924 --> 00:02:50.247
He saw Zeba come into the hall and take a seat in a corner by the wall.

43
00:02:51.316 --> 00:02:54.018
"Who is this woman and what is she carrying?"

44
00:02:54.519 --> 00:02:55.099
he wondered.

45
00:02:55.119 --> 00:02:58.582
"What business does she have with the sultan?"

46
00:03:01.485 --> 00:03:04.988
Trumpets blew as the sultan entered and sat on his throne.

47
00:03:06.108 --> 00:03:11.613
As each person stepped before the sultan and asked for a favor, Zeba watched and listened.

48
00:03:12.694 --> 00:03:15.536
But she was too afraid to speak to the sultan that day.

49
00:03:16.537 --> 00:03:18.899
When the meeting was over, she returned home.

50
00:03:20.952 --> 00:03:24.635
Every day, Zeba went to the hall and sat in the same spot.

51
00:03:25.856 --> 00:03:30.559
Many days passed, but still she did not dare speak to the sultan about her son.

52
00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:34.081
Each night, she returned home with the jewels.

53
00:03:35.663 --> 00:03:38.865
One day, the sultan leaned close to the grand vizier.

54
00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:42.547
"Who is that woman who comes each day?"

55
00:03:42.948 --> 00:03:43.588
he whispered.

56
00:03:43.608 --> 00:03:45.970
"And what does she want?"

57
00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:51.373
"She's nobody important," replied the grand vizier with a frown.

58
00:03:51.393 --> 00:03:55.434
"She probably wants to complain about her neighbors."

59
00:03:57.475 --> 00:04:00.196
The sultan was not satisfied with this answer.

60
00:04:00.216 --> 00:04:03.657
"Tomorrow, bring her before me."

61
00:04:04.897 --> 00:04:07.878
The next day, Zeba sat in her usual corner.

62
00:04:09.038 --> 00:04:13.360
As she sat watching and waiting, she saw the grand vizier point to her.

63
00:04:14.721 --> 00:04:19.234
"Stand," he commanded, "and be presented to the sultan!"
